---
name: "Contact"
title: "Contact Lightening Lives | Hyderabad, India"
description: "Talk to our scientific team about genetic testing for your hospital, laboratory, programme or CSR initiative. Hyderabad, India."
label: Contact
h1: 'Talk to us. <span class="h-mark">Tell us who you are and what you need.</span>'
lead: "Our scientific team reads every enquiry and replies with how we would approach it."
notice: true
closing: false
---
{#- Contact (content file 5.9; three sections since 25 October 2026, the reviewer's site map, 3.1):
    who you are (four choices that set the form and its subject, ?enquiry=) with the form beside it;
    direct contact and the two addresses; the notice for individuals. GitHub Pages cannot process a
    form: with site.forms.web3formsKey set it posts to Web3Forms, otherwise it opens the visitor's
    email app with the enquiry written out (contact.js). Without script it is a mailto form. A test's
    page sends ?condition=<slug>, which ticks that condition. No CAPTCHA: a hidden field catches bots. -#}
{%- set arrow = '<svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="12" viewBox="0 0 18 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M1 6h15M11 1l5 5-5 5"/></svg>' %}
{%- set key = site.forms.web3formsKey %}
{%- set who = [
  { id: "scientific", icon: "hospital", label: "Hospital or laboratory", line: "Run LitLife™ tests, or confirm a diagnosis" },
  { id: "programme", icon: "landmark", label: "Public health programme", line: "Screening at district or state scale" },
  { id: "funder", icon: "hand-heart", label: "CSR or NGO", line: "Fund or co-run a programme" },
  { id: "develop", icon: "flask-conical", label: "New test, research or media", line: "Propose a condition, or anything else" }
] %}
{%- set conditions = [
  { slug: "sickle-cell-anaemia", name: "Sickle cell anaemia" },
  { slug: "thalassaemia", name: "Thalassaemia, HbD or HbE" },
  { slug: "spinal-muscular-atrophy", name: "Spinal muscular atrophy" },
  { slug: "duchenne-muscular-dystrophy", name: "Duchenne muscular dystrophy" },
  { slug: "limb-girdle-muscular-dystrophy", name: "Limb-girdle muscular dystrophy" },
  { slug: "other", name: "Another condition" }
] %}

  <!-- 1. Who you are, and the form -->
  <section id="enquiry" class="section on-mist contact-form-band" aria-labelledby="enquiry-h" data-contact>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="enquiry-h" class="sr-only">Send an enquiry</h2>
      <form class="enquiry" data-enquiry method="post"
        {%- if key %} action="{{ site.forms.endpoint }}"{% else %} action="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Enquiry" enctype="text/plain"{% endif %}
        data-email="{{ site.email }}" data-mode="{{ 'web3forms' if key else 'email' }}">
        {%- if key %}
        <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="{{ key }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="lighteninglives.in">
        <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Enquiry from the website" data-subject>
        {%- endif %}
        <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" class="enquiry-trap" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">

        <fieldset class="enquiry-who">
          <legend>Who are you?</legend>
          <div class="who-choices">
            {%- for w in who %}
            <label class="who-choice">
              <input type="radio" name="enquiry" value="{{ w.id }}"{% if loop.first %} checked{% endif %} required>
              <span class="who-face">
                <span class="icon-tile">{% icon w.icon %}</span>
                <span class="who-label">{{ w.label }}</span>
                <span class="who-line">{{ w.line }}</span>
              </span>
            </label>
            {%- endfor %}
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="enquiry-fields">
          <label class="field"><span>Your name</span><input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required></label>
          <label class="field"><span>Organisation</span><input name="organisation" type="text" autocomplete="organization" required></label>
          <label class="field"><span>Your role</span><input name="role" type="text" autocomplete="organization-title"></label>
          <label class="field"><span>State</span><input name="state" type="text" autocomplete="address-level1" list="states"></label>
          <label class="field"><span>Email</span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label>
          <label class="field"><span>Phone <small>(optional)</small></span><input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel"></label>
          <datalist id="states">
            {%- for st in ["Andhra Pradesh", "Assam", "Bihar", "Chhattisgarh", "Delhi", "Gujarat", "Haryana", "Jharkhand", "Karnataka", "Kerala", "Madhya Pradesh", "Maharashtra", "Odisha", "Punjab", "Rajasthan", "Tamil Nadu", "Telangana", "Uttar Pradesh", "Uttarakhand", "West Bengal"] %}
            <option value="{{ st }}"></option>
            {%- endfor %}
          </datalist>
        </div>

        <fieldset class="enquiry-conditions">
          <legend>Conditions of interest <small>(any that apply)</small></legend>
          <div class="condition-checks">
            {%- for c in conditions %}
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="conditions[]" value="{{ c.name }}" data-slug="{{ c.slug }}"><span>{{ c.name }}</span></label>
            {%- endfor %}
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <label class="field field-wide"><span>Your message</span><textarea name="message" rows="5" required placeholder="The setting, roughly how many people, and the laboratory you have in mind."></textarea></label>

        <div class="enquiry-send">
          <p class="enquiry-consent">We use these details only to reply to you. <a class="link" href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></p>
          <button class="btn btn-solid" type="submit">{% icon "send" %}Send enquiry</button>
        </div>
        <p class="enquiry-status" data-enquiry-status role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. Direct, and where we are -->
  <section id="direct" class="section bg-paper" aria-labelledby="direct-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-start">
        <h2 id="direct-h" class="h2 lg:col-span-7">Or reach us <span class="h-mark">directly.</span></h2>
        <p class="lead lg:col-span-5">Write, call or message on WhatsApp.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="direct mt-12">
        <ul class="direct-ways">
          <li><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}"><span class="icon-tile">{% icon "mail" %}</span><span><b>Email</b><small>{{ site.email }}</small></span></a></li>
          <li><a href="tel:{{ site.tel }}"><span class="icon-tile">{% icon "phone" %}</span><span><b>Call</b><small>{{ site.phone | replace(" ", "&nbsp;") | safe }}</small></span></a></li>
          {%- if site.whatsapp %}
          <li><a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.tel | replace('+', '') }}" rel="noopener"><span class="icon-tile">{% icon "message-circle" %}</span><span><b>WhatsApp</b><small>{{ site.phone | replace(" ", "&nbsp;") | safe }}</small></span></a></li>
          {%- endif %}
        </ul>
        <ul class="addresses-cards" id="where-we-are">
          {%- for key, a in site.addresses %}
          {%- set full = a.street + ", " + a.locality + ", " + a.region + " " + a.postcode %}
          <li>
            <h3>{% icon "map-pin" %}{{ a.label }}</h3>
            <address>{{ full }}</address>
            <a class="link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query={{ full | urlencode }}" rel="noopener">Open in maps<span class="sr-only">: {{ a.label }}</span> {{ arrow | safe }}</a>
          </li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
